#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:40
msgid "Flavor Agent mediates AI changes through one governed loop: AI proposes; WordPress approves. This page configures the plugin-owned backends behind that loop."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:41
msgid "Use Connectors for text generation. Flavor Agent shows the active chat path here."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:42
msgid "Use this page for embedding credentials, pattern storage, developer-doc grounding limits, Guidelines, and AI Activity logging controls."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:43
msgid "When core Guidelines are available, Flavor Agent reads them first. Legacy fields remain available for migration and rollback."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:50
msgid "Models & Storage"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:54
msgid "Embedding credentials power semantic matching, including Qdrant pattern recommendations."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:55
msgid "Pattern Storage chooses where the pattern catalog is indexed. Qdrant uses the configured Embedding Model."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:56
msgid "Private AI Search pattern storage reuses the Cloudflare account and token from the Embedding Model section. Flavor Agent creates and owns a dedicated pattern index when Cloudflare AI Search Pattern Storage is selected."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:57
msgid "Qdrant and AI Search scores use different scales, so tune thresholds separately."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:64
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:68
msgid "Developer Docs use the built-in developer.wordpress.org grounding path. The only runtime warning is a temporarily unreachable search backend; recommendations still run without grounding."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:69
msgid "The Developer Docs group shows compact runtime status. Detailed grounding diagnostics, fingerprints, and request history belong in AI Activity entries and validation logs rather than the primary settings form."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:70
msgid "Pattern Sync stays unavailable until the selected storage path is configured. The sync panel shows stale reasons, last errors, and technical index details."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:71
msgid "When core Guidelines are available, Flavor Agent reads them first."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:72
msgid "Guidelines import fills the form. Save Changes persists imported values, and export uses the Gutenberg-compatible guideline_categories JSON shape."
msgstr ""

#: inc/Admin/Settings/Help.php:73
msgid "AI Activity Dual Logging keeps Flavor Agent request diagnostics alongside core AI Request Logs when core logging is enabled."
msgstr ""

